        "title": "Specialty Glass - Borosilicate, Lead Crystal, Optical, Glass-Ceramics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Standard soda-lime glass handles ~90% of all applications. For the other 10%, specialized compositions enable performance impossible from a commodity material: the thermal shock resistance of Pyrex, the near-zero expansion of Zerodur, the extreme scratch resistance of Gorilla Glass, or the transparency of fused silica at 193nm wavelengths used in chip fabrication."
