        "title": "Specialty Glass - Borosilicate, Lead Crystal, Optical, Glass-Ceramics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "GLASS TYPE          KEY PROPERTY         PRIMARY APP\n————————————        ————————————————     ——————————————————————————\nBorosilicate        Low CTE (3.3×10⁻⁶)  Lab, cookware, pharma, lighting\nFused silica        Ultra-low CTE;        Semiconductor, UV optics,\n                    UV transparent        telescope mirrors\nLead crystal        High RI (1.56);       Cut tableware, historical optics\n                    High dispersion\nAluminosilicate     Ion-exchangeable;     Smartphone screens (Gorilla Glass)\n(Corning Gorilla)   High strength\nGlass-ceramics      Near-zero CTE;        Telescope mirrors (Zerodur),\n                    tunable properties    cooktops (Ceran), dinnerware (Corelle)\nOptical glass       Precise RI+Abbe       Camera lenses, microscopes, lasers\nChalcogenide        IR transparent        Thermal imaging optics\nFluoride (ZBLAN)    Mid-IR transparent    Specialty fiber optics\n```"
